      "id": "05-01",
      "title": "Which route should this packet take?",
      "chapter": "The routing puzzle",
      "duration": 21.6,
      "narration": "The shortest-looking campus shortcut isn't always the quickest. Networks face a similar puzzle: several paths can reach the destination, but which has the lowest total cost? Let's help this packet choose without relying on vibes.",
      "bullets": [
        "One destination, several paths",
        "Best depends on the metric"
      ],
      "takeaway": "A route is best only relative to its chosen metric.",
