    {
      "id": "05-03",
      "title": "Add costs, not just hops",
      "chapter": "The routing puzzle",
      "duration": 21.166666666666668,
      "narration": "The route A-B-D-F adds up to fifteen. A-C-B-D-E-F has more steps, but costs thirteen. Surprise: fewer links doesn't always mean a better route. Add the costs before declaring that shortcut a winner.",
      "bullets": [
